{
 "_comment": "Reference lists the app reads: the muscles, fitness types and equipment it offers, plus the activities an exercise can be filed under and the vocabularies their category and location fields draw from. Edited on the catalog admin site and pulled into the app from the Dev Tools screens. Rows carry a permanent `sourceId` (v30+) the app matches on, so a rename keeps the row's identity; pre-v30 installs still match by name. In `activityTypes`, `name` is the token stored in exercise_definitions.activityType and published in exercises.json, and `behavesLike` names the WorkoutType (logging mode) a new exercise with that activity defaults to.",
